<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Forim hikes eps by 67 pct.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Forim hikes eps by 67 pct.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year year ended February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, (cts)		    32.8	   vs  10.6</p>
<p>    Div (cts)			2.5	   vs   2.0</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	    7.98	   vs  4.03</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			11.13	   vs  4.85</p>
<p>    Tax			     3.15	   vs  .816</p>
<p>    Interest paid		 2.27	   vs  2.12</p>
<p>    Turnover		     89.70	   vs 63.19</p>
<p>Full name: Forim Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The group referred shareholders to the results of its listed subsidiary Alliance Pharmaceuticals Ltd and to the announcement relating to the acquisition of GRS Medical and the further cautionary announcement published simultaneously.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
